{
  "title": "高等科学体系 · 学术站点（Higher Science — Academic Site）",
  "description": "「高等科学体系」的学术站点源码与内容存档。该体系以信息本体论为基底，区分初等科学（对象可拆装、由外力组织）与高等科学（整体统摄成员、不可拆装），提出反身性统摄、认知权、生成逻辑、非还原律等核心命题，并给出 MIA（数学信息公设）形式化层。本站点为该体系的对外发布载体，包含文章、栏目、术语表与站点构建脚本。站点地址 http://higher-science.cn/ ，镜像 https://higher-science.github.io/ 。\n\nThe source code and content archive of the Higher Science academic website, presenting an information-ontology-based framework that distinguishes elementary science (decomposable, externally organised) from higher science (irreducibly holistic, self-organising), with the core concepts of reflexive subsumption, cognitive rights, generative logic, and the non-reduction law.",
  "creators": [
